   "source": [
    "# Future Factory IoT-Enhanced Process Mining Pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates the complete pipeline for analyzing real-world manufacturing data from the Future Factory testbed. The pipeline includes:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Data Loading & Exploration**: Load raw sensor data and understand its structure\n",
    "2. **Data Quality Detection**: Identify noise, missing values, drift, and anomalies\n",
    "3. **Event Abstraction**: Transform sensor patterns into high-level process events\n",
    "4. **Case Correlation**: Group events into process instances using cycle counters\n",
    "5. **Ground Truth Selection**: Select a baseline \"normal\" cycle as reference\n",
    "6. **Conformance Checking**: Compare cycles against the baseline model\n",
    "7. **Backtracking & Explanation**: Trace conformance issues to root causes in sensor data\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset captures a 30-hour manufacturing process with 4 robots assembling rocket prototypes, including both normal and defective assemblies."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "22e5cb41",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
